  "answer": "```python\ndef stable_unique(values):\n    seen = set()\n    result = []\n    for v in values:\n        if (isinstance(v, int) or isinstance(v, str)) and not isinstance(v, bool):\n            if v not in seen:\n                seen.add(v)\n                result.append(v)\n        else:\n            result.append(v)\n    return result\n```\n",
